    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "Ah, makes sense! Might be worth explaining that we don't want to use the `classnames` dependency here because it's used in other flavors, then?\r\n\r\nAnother suggestion would be to use:\r\n\r\n```ts\r\nconst className = [\r\n  suit({\r\n    descendantName: 'highlighted',\r\n  }),\r\n  cssClasses.highlighted,\r\n]\r\n  .filter(Boolean)\r\n  .join(' ');\r\n```\r\n\r\nThat's rather a matter of taste, so feel free to keep it that way.",
    "commit_id": "76b439b1e4eec75f4a80fe7bb8d8545a55bd0892",
